msgstr "फाइलहरू मात्र"

#: includes/class-admin.php:301
msgid "Note (optional)"
msgstr "टिप्पणी (वैकल्पिक)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:304
msgid "Each part is uploaded to your storage and removed from this server before the next one is made, so the backup never takes up room on your hosting."
msgstr "अर्को भाग बनाउनु भन्दा पहिले प्रत्येक भाग तपाईंको भण्डारणमा अपलोड गरिन्छ र यो सर्भरबाट हटाइन्छ, त्यसैले ब्याकअपले तपाईंको होस्टिङमा कहिल्यै ठाउँ लिँदैन।"

#: includes/class-admin.php:307
msgid "Your backups"
msgstr "तपाईंको ब्याकअपहरू"

#: includes/class-admin.php:307
